; Tests that only `./test --full` runs (`dune build @runtest-full`): the
; slow ones (git, subprocesses, servers, timers: about 100ms of CPU or 1s
; or more each), in test/full/ and test/terminal/, vendored directories that
; @runtest leaves out. test/full/test_x_full.ml holds test/test_x.ml's slow
; tests and opens Test_x for its helpers; test_x.ml keeps the cheap ones, so
; every area still has tests in the default run.

(rule
 (alias runtest-full)
 (deps
  (alias test/full/runtest)
  (alias test/terminal/runtest))
 (action
  (progn)))
